msgid "An address or a range, such as 10.77.0.0/24 for a tunnel on a bridge. That proxy needs a network of its own, not Docker's default bridge. Separate several with commas."
msgstr "地址或范围，例如隧道在桥接网络上时的 10.77.0.0/24。该代理需要自己的网络，而不是 Docker 默认的 bridge。多个之间用逗号分隔。"

