msgid "For a private network with nothing in front. Without this, a request to the server's own address gets a 404."
msgstr "用于前面没有任何代理的私有网络。否则，发往服务器自身地址的请求会得到 404。"

msgid "It answers anyone who can reach port 80 over plain HTTP, around whatever is in front. You approve this in the plan."
msgstr "它会通过明文 HTTP 响应任何能访问 80 端口的人，绕过前面的任何代理。你需要在计划中批准此项。"

msgid "It's on the server's own network, so what it listens on there, such as 8080. Port 80 is the proxy's."
msgstr "它在服务器自身的网络上，因此填写它在那里监听的端口，例如 8080。80 端口由代理占用。"

msgid "Its certificate comes by itself once the domain reaches this server, whether you set its DNS before adding it or after."
msgstr "域名能到达此服务器后，证书会自动获取。DNS 在添加之前或之后设置都可以。"

msgid "Move {typed} behind what's in front"
msgstr "将 {typed} 移到前面的代理之后"

msgid "Name the domain, such as app.example.com."
msgstr "请填写域名，例如 app.example.com。"

msgid "Name what connects to this server, as an address or a range."
msgstr "请以地址或范围的形式，写明连接此服务器的来源。"

