msgid "Anyone who can read this app can see it. It can't be hidden there, so if it's a secret, set it in environment for the app to read instead."
msgstr "能读取此应用的任何人都能看到它。这里无法隐藏它，因此如果它是机密，请改为在 environment 中设置，让应用从那里读取。"

msgid "Anyone who can read this app can see it. Its value has a space, a quote or another character Compose reads as part of the line, so one name can't stand for it. To keep it hidden, write the {where} as a list, with each word its own variable."
msgstr "能读取此应用的任何人都能看到它。它的值含有空格、引号或 Compose 会当作这一行一部分来读的其他字符，所以一个名称无法代表它。要隐藏它，请把{where}写成列表，每个词使用各自的变量。"

msgid "Anyone who can read this app can see it. Only a variable's value is hidden, so don't write a secret in its name."
msgstr "能读取此应用的任何人都能看到它。只有变量的值会被隐藏，因此不要把机密写在变量名中。"

msgid "Check that you have another way in, such as your provider's console, before you apply it."
msgstr "应用前，请确认你还有其他登录途径，例如服务商的控制台。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that network, and it reaches past the server's firewall. Whatever else is on it, other projects' services too, can reach {name}, and it them."
msgstr "该网络不是 Dockwell 创建的，并且可以绕过服务器的防火墙。网络上的其他内容（包括其他项目的服务）都能访问 {name}，它也能访问它们。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that network. Whatever else is on it, other projects' services too, can reach {name}, and it them."
msgstr "该网络不是 Dockwell 创建的。网络上的其他内容（包括其他项目的服务）都能访问 {name}，它也能访问它们。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that volume, and won't delete it. Whatever else mounts it shares what it holds."
msgstr "该卷不是 Dockwell 创建的，Dockwell 也不会删除它。其他挂载它的容器会共享其中的内容。"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} goes back to what was there before the restore"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会回到恢复之前的状态"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} is replaced with the copy from {taken}"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会被替换为 {taken} 的副本"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} is replaced with the dump from {taken}"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会被替换为 {taken} 的转储"

msgid "Files changed as they were read, so it can hold half a write, and the app may not start from it."
msgstr "文件在读取时发生了变化，因此可能包含写到一半的内容，应用可能无法从中启动。"

msgid "If a backup fails, the upgrade stops there, with nothing else done. Undoing this puts the old version back, but not what the new one changed in its data: restore the backup for that."
msgstr "如果备份失败，升级会就此停止，不做其他操作。撤销会恢复旧版本，但不会恢复新版本对数据的改动：如需恢复数据，请恢复备份。"

msgid "If {name} is rolled back, {names} stays as it is: what the new version writes there isn't undone."
msgstr "如果回滚 {name}，{names} 会保持原样：新版本写入的内容不会被撤销。"

msgid "It came from the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, whatever runs that acts on this container. After that, starting the project again starts a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. If a panel or a script runs it, find out what its remove does to {where} before you use it, as it may delete what this service mounts. If you ran docker compose yourself, don't run that file again."
msgstr "它来自 Compose 项目 {project}。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，运行该项目的工具会作用于这个容器。更换之后，再次启动该项目会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。如果是面板或脚本在运行它，使用其移除功能之前，请先弄清楚这会对 {where} 做什么，因为它可能会删除此服务挂载的内容。如果是你自己运行的 docker compose，请不要再运行那个文件。"

msgid "It can read and write that path on the server."
msgstr "它可以读写服务器上的该路径。"

msgid "It can read that path on the server."
msgstr "它可以读取服务器上的该路径。"

msgid "It can take half the server's memory. Give it one, such as {target}:size=64m, or give {name} a memory limit."
msgstr "它最多可以占用服务器一半的内存。请设置大小,例如 {target}:size=64m,或者为 {name} 设置内存上限。"

msgid "It can write to <0>{holder}</0>, which holds <1>{held}</1>, which it mounts as well. So it can turn that into a link to anywhere on the server, which it follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {name} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "它可以写入包含 <1>{held}</1> 的 <0>{holder}</0>，而它自己也挂载了 <1>{held}</1>。所以它能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {name} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "It can write to <0>{holder}</0>, which holds <1>{held}</1>, which {holdsFor} mounts. So it can turn that into a link to anywhere on the server, which {holdsFor} follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {name} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "它可以写入包含 <1>{held}</1> 的 <0>{holder}</0>，而 {holdsFor} 挂载了 <1>{held}</1>。所以它能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，{holdsFor} 下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {name} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "It can't be read meanwhile, and it goes once the server is back and the 7 days are up."
msgstr "在此期间无法读取；服务器恢复连接且满 7 天后，这些日志会被删除。"

msgid "It has the Linux capability <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它拥有 Linux 能力 <0>{path}</0>，相当于 root。"

msgid "It joins the group <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它加入用户组 <0>{path}</0>，相当于 root。"

msgid "It leads to <0>{leadsTo}</0> through a symlink, and it can read and write what is there."
msgstr "它通过符号链接指向 <0>{leadsTo}</0>，并可以读写那里的内容。"

msgid "It leads to <0>{leadsTo}</0> through a symlink, and it can read what is there."
msgstr "它通过符号链接指向 <0>{leadsTo}</0>，并可以读取那里的内容。"

msgid "It leads to <0>{leadsTo}</0> through a symlink, and the server's security rests on what is there, so reaching it is as good as root."
msgstr "它通过符号链接指向 <0>{leadsTo}</0>，而服务器的安全取决于那里的内容，所以能访问它就相当于拥有 root。"

msgid "It reaches what the server reaches, past Docker's network and the firewall."
msgstr "它能访问服务器能访问的一切，绕过 Docker 网络和防火墙。"

msgid "It runs in privileged mode, which gives it every device and capability on the server."
msgstr "它以特权模式运行，可使用服务器上的所有设备和能力。"

msgid "It runs through the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, anything done to it in 1Panel acts on this container. After that, 1Panel shows it in error, as it can't find the container. Leave that as it is: Start, Rebuild, Upgrade or editing its settings there starts a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. Don't uninstall it in 1Panel, at either point: that deletes {where}, which holds what this service mounts."
msgstr "它通过 Compose 项目 {project} 运行。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，在 1Panel 中对它的任何操作都会作用于这个容器。更换之后，1Panel 会显示它出错，因为找不到这个容器。不要理会这个状态：在那里启动、重建、升级或编辑其设置都会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。无论何时都不要在 1Panel 中卸载它：那会删除 {where}，其中保存着此服务挂载的内容。"

msgid "It runs through the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, what you do to it in {tool} acts on this container. After that, starting or redeploying it there can start a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. Before you remove it there, find out what that does to {where}, as it may delete what this service mounts."
msgstr "它通过 Compose 项目 {project} 运行。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，你在 {tool} 中的操作会作用于这个容器。更换之后，在那里启动或重新部署可能会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。在那里移除它之前，请先弄清楚这会对 {where} 做什么，因为它可能会删除此服务挂载的内容。"

msgid "It takes that proxy's word for where a request came from."
msgstr "它会相信该代理所说的请求来源。"

msgid "It takes that proxy's word for where a request came from. Whatever else is in that range can reach the route, and say who its client is, so name a network the proxy has to itself."
msgstr "它会相信该代理所说的请求来源。该范围内的其他任何东西都能访问这条路由，并声称其客户端是谁，所以请指定一个由该代理独占的网络。"

msgid "It took too long to measure. If an hour is too short, this stops there, with nothing else done. Back it up once from Backups, and the next plan goes by how large that was."
msgstr "测量耗时过长。如果一小时不够，操作会在此停止，其他内容都不会改动。先在“备份”中备份一次，下次计划就会按那次的大小计算。"

msgid "Its environment comes into Dockwell with it, sealed. No plan or log shows a value of it, and it keeps running."
msgstr "它的环境变量会加密后一同进入 Dockwell。任何计划或日志都不会显示其值，容器也会继续运行。"

msgid "Its volumes are backed up first"
msgstr "它的卷会先备份"

msgid "More than one container answers to {shared} on {network}"
msgstr "在 {network} 上有多个容器响应 {shared}"

msgid "No backup is taken first"
msgstr "升级前不会创建备份"

msgid "No backup was taken, and the data stays as it is now"
msgstr "没有做过备份,数据保持现状"

msgid "Pulls {image} again, and replaces {name} only if that's a newer image."
msgstr "将重新拉取 {image}，只有镜像更新时才会替换 {name}。"

msgid "Pulls {image} again, and replaces {name} whatever that finds, as more than its image differs."
msgstr "重新拉取 {image}，并且无论结果如何都会替换 {name}，因为不只是镜像有差异。"

msgid "Pulls {image} again, and replaces {name} with what that names now, in place of the digest it's pinned to."
msgstr "重新拉取 {image}，并用它现在指向的内容替换 {name}，不再固定于原来的摘要。"

msgid "Read it for the rest before you pass one a secret."
msgstr "在向其中传入密钥之前，请先阅读文件中的其余部分。"

msgid "Revision {revision} ran different images of {image} on each server, so {name} runs what {image} is now"
msgstr "修订版本 {revision} 在各服务器上运行的 {image} 镜像不同，因此 {name} 将运行 {image} 当前指向的镜像"

msgid "Something may still manage {container}"
msgstr "可能还有其他工具在管理 {container}"

msgid "That copy is {size}. What was made since goes. The server keeps a copy of what's there now for 7 days, and undoing this puts it back."
msgstr "该副本大小为 {size}。此后新增的内容都会消失。服务器会将现有内容的副本保留 7 天，撤销此操作即可恢复。"

msgid "That goes beyond what Docker gives a container by default."
msgstr "这超出了 Docker 默认给容器的权限。"

msgid "That goes beyond what Docker keeps for it."
msgstr "这超出了 Docker 为它保留的范围。"

msgid "That is the same as root if it is the group that owns Docker's socket on the server."
msgstr "如果它是服务器上拥有 Docker 套接字的用户组，就相当于 root。"

msgid "That is the server itself, past its containers, at {at} over plain HTTP."
msgstr "这是服务器本身，绕过其容器，通过明文 HTTP 位于 {at}。"

msgid "That is the server itself, past its containers, at {at}."
msgstr "这是服务器本身，绕过其容器，位于 {at}。"

msgid "That's what the server kept on {taken}, {size}. What's in the volume now goes to a copy the server keeps for 7 days."
msgstr "这是服务器在 {taken} 保留的内容，大小为 {size}。卷中现有内容会存为副本，服务器保留 7 天。"

msgid "The data stays as it is now"
msgstr "数据保持现状"

msgid "The database may not start on files from another release. Deploy {writtenBy} first and restore then, or restore a dump instead."
msgstr "数据库可能无法用其他版本的文件启动。请先部署 {writtenBy} 再恢复，或者改为恢复转储。"

msgid "The file writes more variables in plain sight than these"
msgstr "该文件以明文写出的变量比这里列出的更多"

msgid "The hour {name}'s backup gets is a guess"
msgstr "{name} 备份的一小时时限只是估计"

msgid "The old version may not read its data"
msgstr "旧版本可能无法读取它的数据"

msgid "The server keeps that data for 7 days, and undoing this brings it back. After that it is gone."
msgstr "服务器会将这些数据保留 7 天，撤销可以恢复。此后数据将被删除。"

msgid "The server's security rests on what is there, so reaching it is as good as root."
msgstr "服务器的安全取决于那里的内容，所以能访问它就相当于拥有 root。"

msgid "The server's security rests on what that reaches, so it is as good as root."
msgstr "服务器的安全取决于它能访问的内容，所以这相当于拥有 root。"

msgid "The {image} that revision {revision} ran, {digest}, isn't on the server, and its registry won't give it, so {name} runs what {image} is now"
msgstr "修订版本 {revision} 运行的 {image}（{digest}）已不在服务器上，其镜像仓库也不提供，因此 {name} 将运行 {image} 当前指向的镜像"

msgid "This backup was taken when the volume reached <0>{path}</0>, so whatever mounts it can read what comes back."
msgstr "这份备份创建时，该卷可访问 <0>{path}</0>，所以任何挂载它的内容都能读取恢复后的数据。"

msgid "This changes what runs: a service of the same name in the file replaces it, and {deleted}, which the file doesn't name, would be deleted. If that isn't what you meant, change name: in the file to give it a project of its own."
msgstr "这会改变正在运行的内容：文件中的同名服务会替换它，而文件未提到的 {deleted} 将被删除。如果这不是你的本意，请修改文件中的 name:，让它有自己的项目。"

msgid "This changes what runs: a service of the same name in the file replaces it. If that isn't what you meant, change name: in the file to give it a project of its own."
msgstr "这会改变正在运行的内容：文件中的同名服务会替换它。如果这不是你的本意，请修改文件中的 name:，让它有自己的项目。"

msgid "This copy was taken with the app running"
msgstr "此副本是在应用运行时复制的"

#. placeholder {0}: server.serverName
msgid "This may cut off access to {0}"
msgstr "这可能切断对 {0} 的访问"

msgid "This one and {also}, as they do now. What asks for {shared} there can reach either, so point what uses it at a name only one of them has."
msgstr "这个容器和 {also}，现在就是如此。在那里请求 {shared} 可能会到达其中任何一个，所以请让使用方指向只有其中一个容器拥有的名称。"

msgid "This plan destroys data, may cut off access, or lets two containers write to one place"
msgstr "此计划会销毁数据、可能切断访问，或让两个容器写入同一处"

msgid "This put the old version back, not its data. If the new version changed that data, such as with a migration, the old one may refuse it or misread it, and no backup was taken. Check that the app reads its data, and restore a backup of your own if it doesn't."
msgstr "这只恢复了旧版本,没有恢复它的数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据(例如做过迁移),旧版本可能拒绝读取或读错,而且没有做过备份。请检查应用能否读取数据,如果不能,请恢复你自己的备份。"

msgid "This put the old version back, not its data. If the new version changed that data, such as with a migration, the old one may refuse it or misread it. Check that the app reads its data, and if it doesn't, restore what the upgrade backed up first: {which}, on {when}."
msgstr "此操作恢复了旧版本，但没有恢复数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据（例如迁移），旧版本可能拒绝或误读。请检查应用能否读取数据，如不能，请恢复升级前创建的备份：{which}，创建于 {when}。"

msgid "This put the old version back, not its data. If the new version changed that data, such as with a migration, the old one may refuse it or misread it. Check that the app reads its data. The backup the upgrade took first is gone."
msgstr "此操作恢复了旧版本，但没有恢复数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据（例如迁移），旧版本可能拒绝或误读。请检查应用能否读取数据。升级前创建的备份已不存在。"

msgid "This puts the old version back, not its data. If the new version changed that data, such as with a migration, the old one may refuse it or misread it, and no backup was taken. Back up what you can't lose first, or stay on the new version."
msgstr "这只会恢复旧版本,不会恢复它的数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据(例如做过迁移),旧版本可能拒绝读取或读错,而且没有做过备份。请先备份不能丢失的内容,或者继续使用新版本。"

msgid "This puts the old version back, not its data. If the new version changed that data, such as with a migration, the old one may refuse it or misread it. The backup the upgrade took first is gone, so back up what you can't lose before this."
msgstr "此操作恢复旧版本，但不恢复数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据（例如迁移），旧版本可能拒绝或误读。升级前创建的备份已不存在，请先备份不能丢失的内容。"

msgid "This puts the old version back, not its data. If the new version changed that data, such as with a migration, the old one may refuse it or misread it. The upgrade backed it up first, in {which}, on {when}: restore that from Backups after this."
msgstr "此操作恢复旧版本，但不恢复数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据（例如迁移），旧版本可能拒绝或误读。升级前的数据保存在 {which} 中，创建于 {when}：完成后可在“备份”中恢复。"

msgid "Two containers may write to {shared}"
msgstr "两个容器可能同时写入 {shared}"

msgid "Undo may not bring everything back."
msgstr "撤销可能无法恢复所有内容。"

msgid "Undo may not bring it back. Back it up first if you need it."
msgstr "撤销可能无法恢复。如有需要，请先备份。"

msgid "What ran before this failed may have changed the data, such as with a migration, and the version that runs now may refuse it or misread it. Check that the app reads its data, and restore a backup of your own if it doesn't."
msgstr "失败之前运行过的版本可能已经改动了数据(例如做过迁移),现在运行的版本可能拒绝读取或读错。请检查应用能否读取数据,如果不能,请恢复你自己的备份。"

msgid "What ran before this failed may have changed the data, such as with a migration, and the version that runs now may refuse it or misread it. Check that the app reads its data, and restore the backup taken first if it doesn't."
msgstr "失败之前运行的内容可能已改动数据（例如迁移），当前运行的版本可能拒绝或误读这些数据。请检查应用能否读取数据，如不能，请恢复事先创建的备份。"

msgid "What stops starts again once the volume is restored. If the restore fails, what's there now goes back first."
msgstr "卷恢复后，被停止的内容会重新启动。如果恢复失败，会先放回现有的内容。"

msgid "Where SELinux is enforced, Docker relabels everything there as private to this app, so nothing else can use it."
msgstr "在启用 SELinux 的服务器上，Docker 会把那里的所有内容重新标记为此应用私有，其他内容都无法再使用。"

msgid "Where SELinux is enforced, Docker relabels everything there, to share it between containers."
msgstr "在启用 SELinux 的服务器上，Docker 会重新标记那里的所有内容，以便在容器之间共享。"

msgid "You asked for none. Undoing this puts the old version back, but not what the new one changed in its data, such as a database it migrated. Back up what you can't lose first."
msgstr "你选择了不备份。撤销会恢复旧版本，但不会恢复新版本对数据的改动，例如已迁移的数据库。请先备份不能丢失的内容。"

msgid "https:// addresses get an error, and browsers that saw HSTS from it refuse plain HTTP until that runs out."
msgstr "https:// 地址将报错，已看到其 HSTS 的浏览器在 HSTS 过期前会拒绝明文 HTTP。"

msgid "the folder it runs from"
msgstr "它运行所在的目录"

#. placeholder {0}: all.length
msgid "{0, plural, one {# resource} other {# resources}}"
msgstr "{0, plural, other {# 项资源}}"

#. placeholder {0}: restore.stops.length
msgid "{0, plural, one {{list} stops while this happens} other {{list} stop while this happens}}"
msgstr "{0, plural, other {{list} 会在此期间停止}}"

msgid "{by} writes there as a user by name, which only its image can say is root or not."
msgstr "{by} 以按名称指定的用户在那里写入，只有它的镜像能确定该用户是不是 root。"

msgid "{by} writes there as its own user, who is root unless the image says otherwise."
msgstr "{by} 以镜像自身的用户在那里写入，除非镜像另有指定，否则就是 root。"

msgid "{by} writes there as root, so it can change any file there, whoever owns it, and leave files that run as root."
msgstr "{by} 以 root 在那里写入，所以无论文件属于谁都能修改，还能留下以 root 运行的文件。"

msgid "{by} writes there. Code from another image asks again, as a program in any image can run as root."
msgstr "{by} 在那里写入。换成其他镜像的代码时需要重新确认，因为任何镜像中的程序都可能以 root 运行。"

msgid "{database} starts anew on an empty volume and loads the dump, {size}, so what was made since goes, and passwords go back to what they were. If it won't load, what's there now comes back. The server keeps a copy of that for 7 days, and undoing this puts it back."
msgstr "{database} 会在空卷上重新启动并载入转储（{size}），因此此后新增的内容都会消失，密码也会恢复为当时的值。如果载入失败，现有内容会恢复。服务器会将现有内容的副本保留 7 天，撤销此操作即可恢复。"

msgid "{heldBy} can move what {path} leads to on {server}"
msgstr "{heldBy} 可以改变 {server} 上 {path} 指向的位置"

msgid "{name} answers plain HTTP on {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上以明文 HTTP 响应 {path}"

msgid "{name} believes the proxy {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上信任代理 {path}"

msgid "{name} can move what {held} leads to on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 可以改变 {server} 上 {held} 指向的位置"

msgid "{name} gets back the data the server kept."
msgstr "{name} 将取回服务器保留的数据。"

msgid "{name} gets back what reached root on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 将恢复曾可访问 {server} root 级内容的备份"

msgid "{name} gets root on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 将获得 {server} 的 root 权限"

msgid "{name} has the Linux capability {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上拥有 Linux 能力 {path}"

msgid "{name} joins the group {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上加入用户组 {path}"

msgid "{name} joins the network {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上加入网络 {path}"

msgid "{name} joins the {leadsTo} network {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上加入 {leadsTo} 网络 {path}"

msgid "{name} keeps what is in {names} as it is"
msgstr "{name} 保留 {names} 中的内容不变"

#. placeholder {0}: server.serverName
msgid "{name} loses its data on {0}"
msgstr "{name} 将丢失它在 {0} 上的数据"

msgid "{name} loses what its image keeps at {paths}"
msgstr "{name} 将失去其镜像保存在 {paths} 的内容"

msgid "{name} may take longer to be healthy, as its image isn't on the server yet."
msgstr "{name} 可能需要更久才能恢复健康，因为它的镜像还不在服务器上。"

msgid "{name} mounts <0>{path}</0>, inside <1>{heldIn}</1>, which {heldBy} can write. So {heldBy} can turn it into a link to anywhere on the server, which {name} follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {heldBy} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "{name} 挂载了 <1>{heldIn}</1> 中的 <0>{path}</0>，而 {heldBy} 可以写入该目录。所以 {heldBy} 能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，{name} 下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {heldBy} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "{name} mounts the volume {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上挂载卷 {path}"

msgid "{name} reaches the port {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上可访问端口 {path}"

msgid "{name} reaches {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 可访问 {server} 上的 {path}"

msgid "{name} reaches {reach} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 可访问 {server} 上的 {reach}"

msgid "{name} runs with the latest value of {names}"
msgstr "{name} 使用 {names} 的最新值运行"

msgid "{name} runs {image} as revision {revision} ran it, {digest}, even if the tag has moved since"
msgstr "{name} 按修订版本 {revision} 当时的方式运行 {image}（{digest}），即使该标签此后已指向别处"

msgid "{name} shares {server}'s own network"
msgstr "{name} 与 {server} 共用其自身的网络"

msgid "{name} stops HTTPS on {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上停止 {path} 的 HTTPS"

msgid "{name} takes on the container {path} on {server}"
msgstr "{name} 在 {server} 上接管容器 {path}"

msgid "{name}'s kept logs can't be read from then on, and go in 7 days. Undoing this brings them back."
msgstr "此后无法读取 {name} 保留的日志，这些日志会在 7 天后删除。撤销此操作可恢复它们。"

msgid "{name}'s rollout order says to start first, so the old and new containers both write there for as long as this takes, which can corrupt a database. Apply this only if the app can take it."
msgstr "{name} 的发布顺序设置为先启动，因此在此过程中新旧容器都会写入那里，这可能损坏数据库。只有在应用能够承受时才应用此计划。"

msgid "{name}'s tmpfs at {target} has no size"
msgstr "{name} 的 tmpfs({target})没有设置大小"

msgid "{name}'s {where} hold the value of {variable}"
msgstr "{name} 的 {where} 中含有 {variable} 的值"

msgid "{name}'s {where} hold the value of {variable} from your .env"
msgstr "{name} 的 {where} 中含有你的 .env 里 {variable} 的值"

msgid "{name}'s {where} holds the value of {variable}"
msgstr "{name} 的 {where} 中含有 {variable} 的值"

msgid "{name}'s {where} holds the value of {variable} from your .env"
msgstr "{name} 的 {where} 中含有你的 .env 里 {variable} 的值"

#. placeholder {0}: line.lead
#. placeholder {0}: line.text
msgid "{name}: {0}"
msgstr "{name}：{0}"

msgid "{project} already runs {names}"
msgstr "{project} 已在运行 {names}"

msgid "{server} is offline, so what it kept of {name} stays on its disk until it's back"
msgstr "{server} 已离线，它保留的 {name} 日志会留在磁盘上，直到它恢复连接"

msgid "{tool} still manages {container}"
msgstr "{tool} 仍在管理 {container}"

msgid "{writtenBy} wrote these files, and {runsOn} runs on them now"
msgstr "这些文件由 {writtenBy} 写入，而现在运行的是 {runsOn}"

msgid "A container on the server's own network listens on the server's ports itself, so two can't run at once, and the old one stops first"
msgstr "服务器自身网络上的容器直接监听服务器的端口，因此两个容器不能同时运行，旧容器会先停止"

msgid "A new container takes over once it has been healthy for {soak}, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it isn't healthy within {healthyWithin}, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "新容器保持健康 {soak} 后接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果它在 {healthyWithin} 内未变为健康，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "A new container takes over once it has been healthy for {soak}, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it isn't healthy within {healthyWithin}, the new one goes, and what runs stays"
msgstr "新容器保持健康 {soak} 后接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果它在 {healthyWithin} 内未变为健康，新容器会被移除，正在运行的容器保留"

msgid "API token"
msgstr "API 令牌"

msgid "Also created {list}"
msgstr "还创建了{list}"

msgid "Also creates {list}"
msgstr "还会创建{list}"

msgid "Anyone visiting {where} gets a browser's connection error, as nothing here answers for that name over HTTPS any more."
msgstr "访问 {where} 的人会看到浏览器连接错误，因为这里不再通过 HTTPS 响应该名称。"

msgid "Anyone visiting {where} gets a refused connection, as nothing answers on this server's port any more."
msgstr "访问 {where} 的人会被拒绝连接，因为此服务器的端口上不再有任何响应。"

msgid "Anyone visiting {where} gets what the rest of {domain} serves, or a 404 if nothing covers that path."
msgstr "访问 {where} 的人会看到 {domain} 其余部分提供的内容；如果没有内容覆盖该路径，则看到 404。"

msgid "Anyone visiting {where} stops reaching it."
msgstr "访问 {where} 的人将无法再访问到它。"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查"

msgid "Checked"
msgstr "已检查"

msgid "Couldn't check"
msgstr "无法检查"

msgid "Couldn't create"
msgstr "无法创建"

msgid "Couldn't delete"
msgstr "无法删除"

msgid "Couldn't deploy {image}"
msgstr "无法部署 {image}"

msgid "Couldn't let go of"
msgstr "无法放开"

msgid "Couldn't publish port {port}"
msgstr "无法发布端口 {port}"

msgid "Couldn't pull {image}"
msgstr "无法拉取 {image}"

msgid "Couldn't replace"
msgstr "无法替换"

msgid "Couldn't roll back to {revision}"
msgstr "无法回滚到 {revision}"

msgid "Couldn't take on"
msgstr "无法接管"

msgid "Couldn't update"
msgstr "无法更新"

msgid "Creating"
msgstr "正在创建"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at Cloudflare's proxy, which can block the certificate authority's check, so its certificate may not come. Set the record to DNS only. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 Cloudflare 的代理，这可能会阻止证书颁发机构的验证，因此可能无法获取证书。请将该记录设为仅 DNS。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}, not this server ({publics}), so its certificate can't come yet. Point it here; it comes once you do. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}，而不是此服务器（{publics}），因此暂时无法获取证书。请将其指向此服务器，之后即可获取证书。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}, not this server, so its certificate can't come yet. {point}. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}，而不是此服务器，因此暂时无法获取证书。{point}。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}. This server goes out from {goesOut}, which may not be its way in, so the agent can't tell whether that is this server. If it isn't, its certificate can't come until it is. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}。此服务器从 {goesOut} 出站，这不一定是入站地址，因此 Agent 无法判断那是否就是此服务器。如果不是，在指向此服务器之前无法获取证书。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}. This server's own addresses are private ({here}), so the agent can't tell whether that is this server. If it isn't, its certificate can't come until it is. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}。此服务器自身的地址都是私有地址（{here}），因此 Agent 无法判断它是否指向此服务器。如果不是，在指向此服务器之前无法获取证书。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "Deleting"
msgstr "正在删除"

msgid "Deploy {image}"
msgstr "部署 {image}"

msgid "Deployed {image}"
msgstr "已部署 {image}"

msgid "Deploying {image}"
msgstr "正在部署 {image}"

msgid "Docker starts {list} again when {server} next restarts, which may take port 80 or 443 from the proxy, and stop this route answering. Keep it stopped with docker update --restart=no {command}"
msgstr "{server} 下次重启时，Docker 会再次启动 {list}，它可能从代理手中夺走 80 或 443 端口，使此路由无法响应。请用 docker update --restart=no {command} 让它保持停止"

msgid "Docker's socket at {path}, which gives control of Docker on the server, the same as root"
msgstr "位于 {path} 的 Docker 套接字，可控制服务器上的 Docker，等同于 root 权限"

msgid "Dockwell can't read where {cantTell} really lands, so it can't say two containers wouldn't write to one place, and the old one stops first. If the app can, set its rollout order to start first"
msgstr "Dockwell 无法读取 {cantTell} 的实际位置，因此无法确定两个容器不会写入同一处，所以旧容器先停止。如果应用支持，请将其发布顺序设置为先启动"

msgid "From the API"
msgstr "来自 API"

msgid "From the CLI"
msgstr "来自 CLI"

msgid "From the panel"
msgstr "来自面板"

msgid "HTTPS on {path}, which stops: https:// addresses get an error, and browsers that saw HSTS from it refuse plain HTTP until that runs out"
msgstr "{path} 上的 HTTPS，它将停止：https:// 地址会报错，见过其 HSTS 的浏览器在该设置到期前也会拒绝纯 HTTP"

msgid "If the new one doesn't come up, nothing of this runs, and a restart has nothing to go back to"
msgstr "如果新容器无法启动，此服务将没有任何容器运行，而重启没有可回退的版本"

msgid "In a shell on the control server"
msgstr "在控制服务器的 shell 中"

msgid "It also removes {extra} more containers of this service, which a rollout that stopped partway or docker compose up --scale left"
msgstr "它还会移除此服务的另外 {extra} 个容器，它们是中途停止的发布或 docker compose up --scale 留下的"

msgid "It answers anyone who can reach {server} on port 80, over plain HTTP, around whatever is in front of it"
msgstr "它通过纯 HTTP 响应任何能访问 {server} 80 端口的人，绕过它前面的任何东西"

msgid "It answers only what runs on {server} itself, such as a tunnel on its own network. Anyone else gets what a name with no route gets"
msgstr "它只响应在 {server} 本机上运行的程序，例如使用其自身网络的隧道。其他人得到的结果和访问没有路由的域名一样"

msgid "It answers only {list}. Anyone else gets what a name with no route gets"
msgstr "它只响应 {list}。其他人得到的结果和访问没有路由的域名一样"

msgid "It has to stay healthy for {soak}. If it isn't healthy within {healthyWithin}, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "它必须保持健康 {soak}。如果在 {healthyWithin} 内未恢复健康，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "It has to stay healthy for {soak}. If it isn't healthy within {healthyWithin}, the new one goes, and what was stopped stays stopped"
msgstr "它必须保持健康 {soak}。如果在 {healthyWithin} 内未恢复健康，新容器会被移除，已停止的容器保持停止"

msgid "Its image keeps data at {imageData}, which two containers mustn't write to at once, so the old one stops first. If the app can, set its rollout order to start first"
msgstr "其镜像将数据保存在 {imageData}，两个容器不能同时写入，因此旧容器会先停止。如果应用支持同时写入，请将其发布顺序设置为先启动"

msgid "Its image puts an empty volume there. {source} stays on the server, as it was"
msgstr "其镜像会在那里放置一个空卷。{source} 原样保留在服务器上"

msgid "Its rollout order says to stop first, so there are never two"
msgstr "其发布顺序设置为先停止，因此不会同时存在两个容器"

msgid "Let go of"
msgstr "放开"

msgid "Letting go of"
msgstr "正在放开"

msgid "Listening there now: {listening}"
msgstr "目前在此监听的是：{listening}"

msgid "No route on {server} takes a certificate after this, so {proxy} frees ports {ports}. Its routes that take none go on answering"
msgstr "此后 {server} 上没有路由需要证书，因此 {proxy} 会释放端口 {ports}。不需要证书的路由会继续响应"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it has kept running for {soak}, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器持续运行 {soak} 后接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果做不到，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it has kept running for {soak}, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what runs stays"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器持续运行 {soak} 后接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果做不到，新容器会被移除，正在运行的容器保留"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it starts, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器启动后即接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果它没有启动，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it starts, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what runs stays"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器启动后即接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果它没有启动，新容器会被移除，正在运行的容器保留"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it has to keep running for {soak}. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它必须持续运行 {soak}。如果做不到，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it has to keep running for {soak}. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what was stopped stays stopped"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它必须持续运行 {soak}。如果做不到，新容器会被移除，已停止的容器保持停止"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it only has to start. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它只需启动。如果它没有启动，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it only has to start. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what was stopped stays stopped"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它只需启动。如果它没有启动，新容器会被移除，已停止的容器保持停止"

msgid "Nothing listens on port {number} yet, so this answers 502 until something does"
msgstr "端口 {number} 上还没有任何程序在监听，所以在有程序监听之前它会返回 502"

msgid "On {networks}, other services can reach the new container by its service's name and by {names} before it has passed its check, beside the old one, as Docker can't add a name to a container later"
msgstr "在 {networks} 上，新容器通过检查之前，其他服务就可以通过其服务名称和 {names} 与旧容器一样访问到它，因为 Docker 无法在之后为容器添加名称"

msgid "On {networks}, other services can reach the new container by its service's name before it has passed its check, beside the old one, as Docker can't add a name to a container later"
msgstr "在 {networks} 上，其他服务可以在新容器通过检查之前通过服务名访问到它，与旧容器并存，因为 Docker 无法在之后为容器添加名称"

msgid "Planned"
msgstr "已计划"

msgid "Point an A or AAAA record at this server's public address"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器公网地址的 A 或 AAAA 记录"

msgid "Point an A record at this server's public address. Dockwell only sees {here} here, which are private, so the internet can't reach it"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器公网地址的 A 记录。Dockwell 在这里只能看到 {here}，这些都是私有地址，互联网无法访问"

msgid "Point an A record at this server's public address. Dockwell only sees {here} here, which is private, so the internet can't reach it"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器公网地址的 A 记录。Dockwell 在这里只能看到 {here}，这是私有地址，互联网无法访问"

msgid "Point an {goesOutRecord} record at {goesOut}, which is how this server reaches the internet. If it's behind a router, that record won't reach it without a forwarded port, and a tunnel needs neither"
msgstr "请添加指向 {goesOut} 的 {goesOutRecord} 记录，这是此服务器访问互联网所用的地址。如果它在路由器之后，没有端口转发时该记录无法到达它，而隧道两者都不需要"

msgid "Point an {record} record at this server, {either}"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器 {either} 的 {record} 记录"

msgid "Publish port"
msgstr "发布端口"

msgid "Publish port {port}"
msgstr "发布端口 {port}"

msgid "Published port"
msgstr "已发布端口"

msgid "Published port {port}"
msgstr "已发布端口 {port}"

msgid "Publishing port {port}"
msgstr "正在发布端口 {port}"

msgid "Pull again"
msgstr "重新拉取"

msgid "Pull {image} again"
msgstr "重新拉取 {image}"

msgid "Pulled again"
msgstr "已重新拉取"

msgid "Pulled {image} again"
msgstr "已重新拉取 {image}"

msgid "Pulling {image} again"
msgstr "正在重新拉取 {image}"

msgid "Queued"
msgstr "排队中"

msgid "Recreates its container"
msgstr "重建它的容器"

msgid "Replacing"
msgstr "正在替换"

msgid "Roll back"
msgstr "回滚"

msgid "Roll back to {revision}"
msgstr "回滚到 {revision}"

msgid "Rolled back to {revision}"
msgstr "已回滚到 {revision}"

msgid "Rolling back to {revision}"
msgstr "正在回滚到 {revision}"

msgid "Rolling, with nothing stopped"
msgstr "滚动更新，不停止任何服务"

msgid "Skipped"
msgstr "已跳过"

msgid "Take on"
msgstr "接管"

msgid "Taking on"
msgstr "正在接管"

msgid "That lets {who} reach port {number}, and what's there sees each caller as this server, 127.0.0.1, which an app that trusts localhost will believe"
msgstr "这让{who}能访问端口 {number}，而那里的程序会把每个调用者都看作此服务器本身（127.0.0.1），信任 localhost 的应用会相信这一点"

msgid "The API"
msgstr "API"

msgid "The CLI"
msgstr "CLI"

msgid "The old container stops first"
msgstr "旧容器先停止"

msgid "The panel"
msgstr "面板"

msgid "The panel takes those ports back for its domain, {panelDomain}. Its address, passkeys and sessions stay as they are"
msgstr "面板将为其域名 {panelDomain} 收回这些端口。它的地址、通行密钥和会话都保持不变"

msgid "The panel's domain, {panelDomain}, moves behind {proxy}. Its address, passkeys and sessions stay as they are, and it keeps its present certificate until {proxy} has its own. HTTPS on it is down for a moment as the ports change hands; the SSH tunnel keeps working"
msgstr "面板的域名 {panelDomain} 将转到 {proxy} 之后。它的地址、通行密钥和会话都保持不变，并继续使用现有证书，直到 {proxy} 获得自己的证书。端口交接时，该域名的 HTTPS 会短暂中断；SSH 隧道仍可使用"

msgid "The route {edited} was edited by hand, and Dockwell leaves it as it is, so the new container has to keep the old one's address, and the old one stops first. Revert or adopt the edit to roll"
msgstr "路由 {edited} 已被手动修改，Dockwell 不会改动它，因此新容器必须沿用旧容器的地址，旧容器先停止。还原或采纳该修改后即可滚动发布"

msgid "This is the first route on {server} that takes a certificate, so {proxy} takes ports {ports} too, and nothing it serves stops"
msgstr "这是 {server} 上第一条需要证书的路由，因此 {proxy} 还会占用端口 {ports}，它提供的服务都不会停止"

msgid "This is the last route on {server}, so {proxy} stops, and ports {ports} are free. Its certificates stay on the server for when a route comes back"
msgstr "这是 {server} 上的最后一条路由，因此 {proxy} 将停止并释放端口 {ports}。证书会保留在服务器上，以便日后再次添加路由时使用"

msgid "This reloads the proxy on {server}, which can reset a connection on its way in to any site there, and lose a POST on a kept HTTP/1.1 connection. A browser sends such a request again, and an app's own client may not"
msgstr "这会重新加载 {server} 上的代理，可能重置正在进入该服务器上任何站点的连接，并可能丢失保持连接的 HTTP/1.1 上的 POST 请求。浏览器会再次发送此类请求，而应用自身的客户端可能不会"

msgid "This server is behind carrier NAT ({here}), so a DNS record can't reach it, and neither can a forwarded port. Use a tunnel, which needs neither"
msgstr "此服务器位于运营商级 NAT 之后（{here}），DNS 记录和端口转发都无法到达它。请使用隧道，两者都不需要"

msgid "Took on"
msgstr "已接管"

